# With Guru Pathik and an Ornithopter (0/2) in play, Bot1 casts Firebending Lesson (a Lesson, on Guru Pathik, 2 damage to a 2/4) and
# Northern Air Temple (a Shrine) on turn 1. Each cast puts a +1/+1 counter on another creature Bot1 controls (the only legal target is
# the Ornithopter, never Guru Pathik itself, so it is chosen without a prompt): the Ornithopter ends 2/4 and Guru Pathik stays 2/4.

